    "innovation": "This paper provides a comprehensive climate analysis of Italy's Castelporziano Presidential Estate from 1980, using multiple datasets to reveal significant warming trends, increased extreme heat events, and a thermal gradient from the coast to the interior that influences the local ecosystem.",
